organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.5.stable, 4.5.dev1\n- Not Reproducible in 4.4.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8115) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-12600K (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn Godot 4.5, moving a fullscreen project between vertical and horizontal monitors causes the project's display to be cut in half. This issue didn't happen in Godot 4.4, where doing that would appropriately resize the project to fit the screen correctly.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a892b4ef-cae8-40a2-a281-b4ad9a638c94\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. In project settings' Window tab, set Mode to Fullscreen and check both Resizable and Borderless options\n2. Run the project\n3. Move the project from a Vertical to a Horizontal monitor (or Vice Versa) using (Win + Shift + left/right arrow key)\n4. The project's window moved, but is now improperly displayed (cut in half)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[screen-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22499620/screen-mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110833/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110833/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}